<title>USA: Lewiston, Maine, won by BayBank Boston.</title>
<headline>Lewiston, Maine, won by BayBank Boston.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>BayBank Boston said it won $3.070 million of Lewiston, Maine, general obligation public improvement bonds, with a true interest cost of 5.0132 percent.</p>
</text>
